        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "41-10 Participants in job sharing agree to half-time teacher status at half their annual salary, as determined by their positions on the adopted salary schedule as a full-time teacher at the time they begin the job sharing assignment.\n41-11 Continuous full-time service will accrue for a teacher in a shared time position on a pro rata basis.",
