            "block_content": "41-12 in determining the placement of a job sharing team, the teachers involved will attempt to arrive at a mutually acceptable decision. If the teachers cannot agree, the teacher with the greatest length of service in the District will make the determination about which position to fill. Said determination must be approved by the principal.",
